        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Katie Leung, Mei Ashley, Li Jun, Sebastian So, Harry Potter, Cho Chang\n- Works: One Child, Harry Potter film series\n- Topics: Character roles, plot premise\n\nFacts:\n- In One Child, Mei Ashley is a girl who discovers that she has a previously unknown brother named Li Jun.\n- In One Child, Li Jun is due to be sentenced to death for a murder he did not commit.\n- Katie Leung portrays Mei Ashley in One Child.\n- Sebastian So portrays Li Jun in One Child.\n- Katie Leung played Cho Chang, the first love interest of Harry Potter, in the Harry Potter film series.",
